<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Short vs Long-Term Rental Cost in Hanoi: Cost Planning</h1>
<p>Automatic scooter rental in Hanoi has a verified rate for every length of stay, and the renter’s only real pricing decision is matching the term to the calendar. Short stays run on daily rates of 150,000 or 200,000 VND, medium stays on weekly rates of 700,000 or 1,000,000 VND, and long stays on monthly rates that start at a verified 900,000 VND band. This guide compares the terms head to head and marks the exact days where each structure takes the lead.</p>
<p>We work through the verified term ladder tier by tier, the short-term case for flexibility, the weekly middle ground and its break-evens, the long-term arithmetic that makes a month so cheap, and the questions that settle the choice before money moves. Every verified rate sits in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, the full fleet is in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a> covers what renters ask most.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">the verified term ladder</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">what short-term means here</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">the weekly middle ground</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">the long-term case</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">planning the budget by term</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">the automatics against each other over time</a></li>
